      "JANIS: I’m not presentable… and I’m really busy now… Well, give me an hour.\nDEBORAH: When I finish the course on Spanish language and literature, I’d like to enroll for another one . Could I continue staying here?\nJANIS: I don’t know… If you stay, you’ll have to listen to everything I tell\nDEBORAH: No… no.",
